     "content": "<h2>Scope of engagement</h2><p>Each mandate is defined in a written quotation listing the services included, the government disbursements payable, and our professional fee. Work outside that scope is quoted separately before it begins.</p><h2>Client responsibilities</h2><p>Clients are responsible for the accuracy and authenticity of documents provided. Files containing inaccurate information may be rejected by the authorities and are not covered by our resubmission commitment.</p><h2>Fees and refunds</h2><p>Government disbursements are non-refundable once paid to the relevant authority. Professional fees are refundable pro rata where work has not commenced.</p><h2>Outcomes</h2><p>Approval decisions rest solely with UAE authorities. We do not guarantee outcomes; we guarantee the quality and completeness of the submission.</p>",
