  "category": "Property",
  "tags": "golden visa uae, buying property, dubai give, residency",
  "metaTitle": "Does buying property in Dubai give you residency?",
  "metaDescription": "Not automatically. A title deed proves ownership; residency needs a separate application through the DLD and GDRFA, with valuation, medical and…",
