  "category": "Property",
  "tags": "golden visa uae, combine several, properties qualify, dubai golden",
  "metaTitle": "Can you combine several properties to qualify for a",
  "metaDescription": "Yes. Properties you own in your own name can be added together to reach the AED 2 million Golden Visa threshold — for example a studio and a…",
