  "category": "Property",
  "tags": "golden visa uae, property valuation, golden visa, purchase price,",
  "metaTitle": "Property valuation and the Golden Visa: purchase",
  "metaDescription": "The AED 2 million threshold is assessed on the value the land department recognises — usually the price on the title deed, or an official valuation…",
