  "tags": "golden visa uae, rental income, qualify golden, visa",
  "metaTitle": "Does rental income qualify you for a Golden Visa?",
  "metaDescription": "No. Rental income on its own does not make you eligible. The property route is based on owning real estate worth AED 2 million or more, not on what it…",
