  "category": "Investment",
  "tags": "golden visa uae, much deposit, investment need, golden visa",
  "metaTitle": "How much deposit or investment do you need for a",
  "metaDescription": "There is no single \"deposit\" for the Golden Visa. Investor routes typically need AED 2 million — in property, an accredited UAE investment fund or a…",
