  "tags": "golden visa uae, switch normal, residence visa, golden visa",
  "metaTitle": "How to switch from a normal residence visa to a",
  "metaDescription": "If you meet a Golden Visa route, apply while your current visa is still valid. Once the Golden Visa is approved, your existing residence is cancelled…",
