  "tags": "golden visa uae, dubai property, visa fees, costs budget",
  "metaTitle": "Dubai property visa fees and costs: what to budget",
  "metaDescription": "Beyond the property price, budget for the DLD transfer fee and trustee charges, the visa application fee, medical test, Emirates ID, health insurance…",
