  "category": "Golden Visa",
  "tags": "golden visa uae, which universities, degrees make, eligible golden",
  "metaTitle": "Which universities and degrees can make you",
  "metaDescription": "A degree alone does not qualify you. Degrees matter in three routes: outstanding graduates of UAE universities and of highly ranked international…",
