  "tags": "golden visa uae, golden visa, affects property, returns resale",
  "metaTitle": "How the Golden Visa affects property returns and",
  "metaDescription": "The Golden Visa adds residency value on top of rental and capital returns, which supports demand for properties at and above AED 2 million. It does not…",
